### Variables (REST Client de VS Code / JetBrains HTTP Client)
@base = http://localhost:8000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Crear pedido
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": { "name": "Ana Gómez", "email": "ana@example.com", "phone": "+57 3001234567" },
  "items": [
    { "sku": "TEC-01", "name": "Teclado mecánico", "quantity": 1, "unit_price": "320000.00" },
    { "sku": "MOU-02", "name": "Mouse inalámbrico", "quantity": 2, "unit_price": "85000.00" }
  ],
  "shipping_address": {
    "street": "Calle 100 # 10-20", "city": "Bogotá", "state": "Cundinamarca",
    "postal_code": "110111", "country": "Colombia"
  }
}

### Listar (más recientes primero)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orders?limit=10

### Filtrar por estado y rango de fechas, orden ascendente
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orders?status=PENDING&created_from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&sort=created_at

### Consultar uno (reemplace el id)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orders/REEMPLAZAR-ID

### Cambiar estado
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/orders/REEMPLAZAR-ID/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "IN_PROCESS", "note": "Pedido en alistamiento" }
